# Generated by `npm run catalog:template` (src/catalog-import/generate-template.ts) and
# served from GET /platform/catalog/template — reproducible from template-schema.ts, so
# a committed copy could silently disagree with the schema that generates it.
equipment-library-template.xlsx

# Something in the local toolchain regenerates this as a byte-identical mirror of
# CLAUDE.md — untracked and harmless while the two agree, but a second copy of the
# working rules that nobody maintains is exactly how a session ends up following
# instructions that were changed a month ago. Deleted from git at 26758c3; ignored
# here so it can't be committed back by accident.
AGENTS.md
